  "raw_code": "(rule!\n ;; Per column, keep only the FIRST yellow(4); everything else clears.\n (let ()\n   (define (row-with-four c)\n     (first (filter (lambda (r) (= (at g r c) 4)) (range h))))\n   (grid-from-fn h w (lambda (r c) (if (= r (row-with-four c)) 4 0)))))",
